body:
RESTART NOTICE RULE for the remote pilot (Greg via Engram::Advisor b9d13887 #1085, 2026-10-17 21:25:35Z), verbatim: "Oczywiście. Jak będzie nowy build, zrestartuje na Windows i Mac." When a new TermAl build needs to go live, the TermAl coordinator sends Greg (through Engram::Advisor) a concise RESTART-NOW notice containing:
- the build hash;
- the affected host(s): Windows A and/or MacBookPro B;
- the reason;
- the safe timing (no host-tracked gate of either project running).
Greg performs the Windows and MacBookPro restarts. Agents never restart, stop or start either host. This extends CLAUDE.md's existing restart rule (coordinators choose the moment; Greg performs it) to the Mac satellite.
